@startuml
title Telegram PMS Bot - System Context Diagram

actor Admin
actor Member

rectangle "Telegram PMS System\nSpring Boot Backend" as PMS {
}

rectangle "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram
database "PostgreSQL Database" as DB

Admin --> PMS : Create private link\nSend broadcast
Member --> Telegram : Press Start\nReceive private link

PMS --> Telegram : Send private messages\nReceive /start updates
PMS --> DB : Store members,\nchat IDs, links,\nmessage logs

Telegram --> Member : Private bot message
Telegram --> PMS : Bot update payload

@enduml